<title>UK: Avon says Q1 trading as expected.</title>
<headline>Avon says Q1 trading as expected.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>British tyre maker Avon Rubber Plc said on Wednesday trading in the first quarter of its financial year was in line with its expectations.</p>
<p>Avon said automative components sales remained strong in north America and Europe and sales of both the tyres and technical products divisions were close to last year's levels.</p>
<p>&quot;Our performance in the year to date supports my statement in the annual report and accounts that we look forward to a year of further progress,&quot; Avon said in a statement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
